@host = https://localhost:59952
@serial = ZK-DEVICE-SERIAL
@sharedKey = REPLACE_WITH_PAYROLL_SETTINGS_API_KEY

### ZKTeco options handshake
GET {{host}}/api/zkteco/iclock/cdata?SN={{serial}}&KEY={{sharedKey}}

### ADMS command poll
GET {{host}}/api/zkteco/iclock/getrequest?SN={{serial}}&KEY={{sharedKey}}

### Submit two attendance punches (PIN maps to EmployeeCode or employee Id)
POST {{host}}/api/zkteco/iclock/cdata?SN={{serial}}&KEY={{sharedKey}}&table=ATTLOG&Stamp=0
Content-Type: text/plain

EMP-000001	2026-09-26 08:55:00	0	1	0	0	0	0
EMP-000001	2026-09-26 17:10:00	1	1	0	0	0	0
